---
permalink: /next/studio/
title: Studio
description: The people of SMASH, an experience design studio in Stockholm.
section: studio
bodyClass: studio-page
styles:
  - studio.css
---
{#- The studio: who SMASH is, the work being made, and the people.
    Media markup is written inline: {% image %} renders nothing inside an
    include or a macro. -#}
{%- set room = ['dome-conductor', 'development.jpg'] %}

<section class="grid page-start" aria-labelledby="studio-title">
  <h1 class="c-1-9 t-large" id="studio-title">A studio of three, working with the makers each piece needs.</h1>
</section>

{%- for p in projects %}{% if p.slug == room[0] %}{% for b in p.blocks %}{% if b.type == 'image' and b.src.endsWith('/' + room[1]) %}
<div class="st-room room">
  <div class="media" style="--ar: {{ b.ar }}">{% image b.src, b.alt, '100vw', 'eager' %}</div>
</div>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="people-title">
  <h2 class="visually-hidden" id="people-title">People</h2>
  <ul class="grid st-team" role="list">
    {%- for p in team %}
    <li class="st-member">
      <div class="media">{{ p.picture | safe }}</div>
      <p class="st-name caption">{{ p.name }}</p>
      <p><a href="mailto:{{ p.email }}">{{ p.email }}</a></p>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
